        misc2 = MisconceptionAnalysis("The nth term of a GP is ar^n.", "Confusion with r^n in S_n.", "First term T_1 = ar^0 = a, so nth term is ar^{n-1} (check n=1 first!).", "Verify n=1 returns first term a before proceeding."),
